    "_about": "Spells by class and spell level, after the AD&D Player's Handbook lists: names and game numbers only, effects described in this project's own words. effect: damage (dice, per_level, max_level, targets), heal, sleep (hit dice affected), hold, bless (to-hit and morale bonus), weaken (armor class penalty), shield (armor class), grow (harvest bonus), calm (beasts break off). Bards cast from the Druid list, as in the Player's Handbook; their inspiring songs are not spells (Data/Magic/magic.py).",

